NAME: Reversi

DESCRIPTION:

The game can be played:
- Human vs Computer
- Computer vs Computer
- Human vs Human

The computer has 3 skill levels: CPU1,
CPU2, CPU3.

NOTES:

The minimax algorithm with Alpha-beta 
pruning is used. Reference: 
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpha%E2%80%93beta_pruning

Just 3 CPU skill levels are provided 
because the Reversi program is executed 
by the Picoc Interpreter, which is much
slower than if it were executed by 
compiled code.
